    "detailed_description": "10 Second Shuriken is a fps platformer. Speed run and master levels within 10 seconds destroying all the enemies to get the fastest time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A game where you only have 10 seconds to beat the level<br></li><li>Jump and shoot your way through 40 levels taking you from grasslands, to laser and ice worlds.<br></li><li>Slice enemies with your samurai sword<br></li><li>Collect and use power ups like teleportation shurikens and jet packs to help you destroy your enemies<br></li><li>A feeling of satisfaction when you kill all the enemies so fast that you get a 3 star rating<br></li><li>Steam achievements<br></li><li>Dodge Lasers,  jump on trampolines, and  destroy odd shaped enemies</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "10 Second Shuriken is a fps platformer. Speed run and master levels within 10 seconds destroying all the enemies to get the fastest time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A game where you only have 10 seconds to beat the level<br></li><li>Jump and shoot your way through 40 levels taking you from grasslands, to laser and ice worlds.<br></li><li>Slice enemies with your samurai sword<br></li><li>Collect and use power ups like teleportation shurikens and jet packs to help you destroy your enemies<br></li><li>A feeling of satisfaction when you kill all the enemies so fast that you get a 3 star rating<br></li><li>Steam achievements<br></li><li>Dodge Lasers,  jump on trampolines, and  destroy odd shaped enemies</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "10 Second Shuriken is a fps platformer. Speedrun your way through levels destroying all the enemies as quickly as you possibly can to get a legendary 3 star rating. JUMP your way through sky islands, enemy projectiles and lasers as you attempt this task in 10 SECONDS.",
